## APPENDIX E — Global Agritech Experience System (v3.2)

### E.1 Experience Definition

The app must feel like a **Smart Greenhouse Control Center powered by AI and Scientific Research**.

NOT a farming game, plant shop, gardening app, or generic Flutter dashboard.

**Experience blend:**
- 40% Apple — precision, whitespace, typography
- 20% Linear — dark elegance, data density
- 15% Tesla — ambient tech, motion
- 10% Vercel — minimal, fast, clean
- 10% John Deere Operations Center — agritech authority
- 5% Climate FieldView — data visualization

### E.2 Global Layered Environment Background

Every key screen (Login, Dashboards) uses a 4-layer background system. Never use full-screen photos.

#### Layer 1 — Sky Gradient
```
Morning Light:
  #EAF6FF → #F4FAFF → #F7FAF5
Dark (Greenhouse Control Center):
  #0F1411 → #18201B
```
#### Layer 2 — Sunlight System
- Position: top-right
- Element: large blurred radial gradient
- Opacity: 5%–10%
- Animation: slow movement, 20–30s cycle
- Purpose: greenhouse morning atmosphere
#### Layer 3 — Scientific Overlay
- Opacity: 2%–4%
- Elements: subtle grid, sensor points, data curves, network nodes
- Purpose: technology + research feeling
#### Layer 4 — Environmental Shapes
- Organic flowing shapes inspired by greenhouse glass, airflow, humidity, growth patterns
- No obvious illustrations

#### Optional Hero Background (Login + Dashboard only)
One of: Abstract Smart Greenhouse | Plant Growth Analytics | Scientific Plant Research | IoT Sensor Network | AI Agriculture Monitoring
- Style: minimal, premium, semi-transparent
- Opacity: 5%–15%
- Never reduce readability

### E.3 Global Motion System

All animations communicate life and intelligence — never decoration.

| Motion | Screens | Duration | Purpose |
|--------|---------|----------|---------|
| Sunlight Movement | Login, Dashboard | 20–30s | Atmosphere |
| Sensor Pulse | IoT, Dashboard, Experiments | 3–5s cycle | Status awareness |
| Growth Animation | Experiments, Dashboard | count-up | Progress visualization |
| AI Insight Fade | Dashboard | 8–12s cycle | Intelligence feel |
| Stagger Entrance | All card lists | 50–100ms delay | Premium polish |
| Floating Particles | Login, Dashboard | very slow | Greenhouse atmosphere |

**Maximum 3–5 floating particles at 3%–5% opacity.**

### E.4 Role Dashboard Differentiation

| Role | Theme | Focus Areas | Color Accent |
|------|-------|------------|--------------|
| Researcher | Research Laboratory | Active Experiments, AI Insights, Data Analysis | #4CAF50 / teal |
| Technician | Operations Center | Sensors, Alerts, Maintenance Tasks | #2196F3 / blue |
| Farm Manager | Executive Analytics | KPI, Growth, Reports, Resource Allocation | #FF9800 / amber |
| Student | Learning & Research | Assigned Tasks, Learning Progress, Experiments | #9C27B0 / purple |

### E.5 Scientific Visual Language (Global)

Every dashboard subtly includes: growth curves, sensor indicators, environmental metrics, research progress, analytics patterns.

Users should subconsciously feel: **Innovation, Precision, Research, Technology**

### E.6 Forbidden Effects

**NEVER use:**
- Flying leaves or particles everywhere
- Cartoon plants or icons
- Gaming-style particles
- Neon glow effects
- Excessive gradients
- Heavy glassmorphism
- Continuous spinning objects
- Flashing animations

### E.7 Global Environment Background Widget

Create `AgritechEnvironmentBackground` in `lib/shared/widgets/` with parameters:

```dart
class AgritechEnvironmentBackground extends StatelessWidget {
  final bool showSunlight;     // Layer 2
  final bool showScientific;    // Layer 3
  final bool showParticles;     // Layer 4
  final bool isHero;           // Optional hero overlay
  final Widget child;
}
```

Apply to: LoginScreen, ResearcherDashboardScreen, TechnicianDashboardScreen, FarmManagerDashboardScreen, AdminDashboardScreen, StudentDashboardScreen.

